        "content": "## Compliance and binary data disposal\nThe customer's audio exists only in the execution's memory (binary \"data\").\n- No Drive, database, or storage nodes.\n- Settings: saving of successful, failed, and manual executions is disabled.\n- The agent's memory stores text only, in RAM, never audio.\nWhen the execution ends, the binary data is discarded.",
